{
  "dom_id": "step-q66937",
  "name": "Question 4",
  "problem": "Find the solution to the equation ${e}^{z}=5$ rounded to $3$ decimal places.",
  "worked_solution": "First, we take $ln$ of both sides of the equation and solve for $z$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{e}^{z} & =5 \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡({e}^{z}) & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5) \\\\ z & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating the above expression using a calculator gives\n\n$$\nz≈1.609\n$$\n\nrounded to $3$ decimal places.",
